{"seq":1,"slug":"transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest","title":"调拨/促销/清仓建议（建议层）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest","wordCount":2028,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"调拨-促销-清仓建议-建议层\">调拨/促销/清仓建议（建议层）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>诊断层回答「哪里有问题」，建议层回答「应该做什么」，执行层才真正动手。<strong>建议层的产品是候选动作与排序，不是决策本身。</strong> 这条边界必须写进系统设计，否则建议系统会逐步吞掉定价权、补货权与采购权，变成没人敢信也不敢关的黑箱。</p>\n<p>建议层输出三类动作，对应库存问题的三种轻重：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>调拨（transfer）</strong>：库存没多，只是位置不对。适用于仓间错配，见 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/onhand-intransit-multichannel-view\">在库+在途+多渠道合并视角</a> 的仓位视图。</li>\n<li><strong>促销（promotion）</strong>：需求还在，只是当前价格或曝光不足以在目标周期内消化。适用于滞销但非结构性失效的库存。</li>\n<li><strong>清仓（markdown/clearance）</strong>：需求已结构性下降或商品接近生命周期终点，目标是尽快回收现金并释放库位与资金。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的选择依据是 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 的四条线：<strong>季节 → 等待或调拨；预测 → 促销消化；定价 → 调价促销；选品 → 清仓退市</strong>。这个映射是建议层最重要的一条规则，它保证动作与根因一致。</p>\n<p>建议层还要输出<strong>执行约束</strong>，而不是只输出动作。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Price_optimization\">Price optimization</a> 的说明，零售定价是「determined through a constrained optimization process」，其输入包括「customer segmentation, market simulators, costs, inventories, and historical sales」，目标是「maximizing operating profit」。建议层的清仓建议天然属于这类约束优化——它必须带上品牌价格底线、渠道冲突约束、以及最小毛利约束，否则降价建议会击穿价格带。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[诊断输出&lt;br/&gt;呆滞/超储/错配] --&gt; B{归因主线}&#10;  B --&gt;|季节| C[等待或跨区调拨]&#10;  B --&gt;|预测| D[促销消化]&#10;  B --&gt;|定价| E[调价 + 促销]&#10;  B --&gt;|选品| F[清仓/退市/退货]&#10;  C --&gt; G[调拨建议]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[约束检查&lt;br/&gt;价格底线/品牌/渠道]&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| I[动作候选 + 排序]&#10;  H --&gt;|拒绝| J[转人工复核]&#10;  I --&gt; K[执行层系统&lt;br/&gt;定价引擎/补货引擎/WMS]&#10;  K --&gt; L[执行结果回写]&#10;  L --&gt; M[效果跟踪&lt;br/&gt;见健康看板]\">graph TD\n  A[诊断输出&lt;br/&gt;呆滞/超储/错配] --&gt; B{归因主线}\n  B --&gt;|季节| C[等待或跨区调拨]\n  B --&gt;|预测| D[促销消化]\n  B --&gt;|定价| E[调价 + 促销]\n  B --&gt;|选品| F[清仓/退市/退货]\n  C --&gt; G[调拨建议]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[约束检查&lt;br/&gt;价格底线/品牌/渠道]\n  H --&gt;|通过| I[动作候选 + 排序]\n  H --&gt;|拒绝| J[转人工复核]\n  I --&gt; K[执行层系统&lt;br/&gt;定价引擎/补货引擎/WMS]\n  K --&gt; L[执行结果回写]\n  L --&gt; M[效果跟踪&lt;br/&gt;见健康看板]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作类型</th>\n<th>适用判据</th>\n<th>目标周期</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n<th>回退路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仓间调拨</td>\n<td>源仓超储 + 目标仓缺货</td>\n<td>2–6 周</td>\n<td>调拨成本 &lt; 缺货损失</td>\n<td>目标仓需求未兑现则二次调拨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境调拨</td>\n<td>源仓死库存 + 目标市场有需求</td>\n<td>6–12 周</td>\n<td>落地成本 &lt; 目标售价 × 0.6</td>\n<td>关税不可退，需高置信度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站内促销</td>\n<td>滞销 + 弹性为负</td>\n<td>2–4 周</td>\n<td>毛利下限、品牌价格带</td>\n<td>促销未达量则升级为清仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多渠道折扣</td>\n<td>主渠道饱和</td>\n<td>4–8 周</td>\n<td>渠道价格冲突</td>\n<td>分渠道差异化以避免比价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清仓降价</td>\n<td>死库存候选 + 归因选品</td>\n<td>4–12 周</td>\n<td>品牌底线、平台比价规则</td>\n<td>阶梯降价，不接受一步到底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货供应商</td>\n<td>质量/合同允许退货</td>\n<td>按合同</td>\n<td>退货条款、退货运费</td>\n<td>超期则转清仓或报废</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捐赠/报废</td>\n<td>残值低于处置成本</td>\n<td>4–8 周</td>\n<td>合规与税务凭证</td>\n<td>需保留处置证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"建议的生成与排序\">建议的生成与排序</h2><h3 id=\"从问题到动作的映射函数\">从问题到动作的映射函数</h3><p>建议生成的核心是一个映射函数：输入（库存状态、归因结论、成本结构、约束），输出（动作类型、参数、置信度）。这个函数必须是<strong>规则驱动 + 参数可覆盖</strong>的：规则决定动作类型，参数（降幅、数量、周期）由优化计算或历史经验给出，且可被品类策略覆盖。</p>\n<p>排序则用<strong>单位资金回收效率</strong>做统一度量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Efficiency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>CashRecovered</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ActionCost</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>ReleaseDays</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>CapitalTied</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Efficiency} = \\frac{\\Delta \\text{CashRecovered} - \\Delta \\text{ActionCost}}{\\Delta \\text{ReleaseDays} \\times \\text{CapitalTied}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Efficiency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ReleaseDays</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CapitalTied</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CashRecovered</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ActionCost</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子是这个动作相比「什么都不做」多回收的现金减去动作成本，分母是释放的资金与释放时长的乘积。这个指标让「小金额快清」和「大金额慢清」可以在同一把尺子上比。分母里的 <code>ReleaseDays</code> 是关键——它把「多快回笼」显式计入，避免建议总是偏向慢速高价清仓。</p>\n<h3 id=\"约束检查必须先于排序\">约束检查必须先于排序</h3><p>约束检查不能放在排序之后做过滤，因为那样会把「唯一可行的大额动作」整体剔除。正确做法是<strong>在生成阶段就把约束作为可行域</strong>：任何建议在生成时就必须满足品牌价格底线、渠道价格冲突规则、最小毛利要求。下面的规则工件给出这个可行域的骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;suggestion_policy&quot;: &quot;v2026.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;generation_rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;cause == &#39;SEASON&#39; AND peer_region_demand &gt; 0&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;TRANSFER&quot;, &quot;fallback&quot;: &quot;WAIT&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;cause == &#39;FORECAST&#39; AND excess_cover_weeks &gt; 12&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;PROMOTION&quot;, &quot;target_cover_weeks&quot;: 8 },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;cause == &#39;PRICING&#39; AND elasticity_est &lt; -1.2&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;REPRICE_PROMO&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;cause == &#39;ASSORTMENT&#39; OR deadstock_state == &#39;DEAD_CANDIDATE&#39;&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;CLEARANCE&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;constraints&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;brand_price_floor_pct&quot;: { &quot;default&quot;: 0.35, &quot;luxury_brands&quot;: 0.55 },&#10;    &quot;min_gross_margin_pct&quot;: { &quot;default&quot;: 0.08, &quot;electronics&quot;: 0.05 },&#10;    &quot;channel_conflict&quot;: { &quot;deny_same_price_within_days&quot;: 14 },&#10;    &quot;max_discount_step_pct&quot;: 0.25,&#10;    &quot;min_action_qty&quot;: 20,&#10;    &quot;transfer_min_savings_ratio&quot;: 1.15&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;ranking&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;cash_recovery_efficiency&quot;,&#10;    &quot;formula&quot;: &quot;(delta_cash_recovered - action_cost) / (release_days * capital_tied)&quot;,&#10;    &quot;tie_breaker&quot;: &quot;capital_tied_desc&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;escalation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;four_eyes_above_amount&quot;: 50000,&#10;    &quot;require_evidence&quot;: [&quot;nrv_estimate&quot;, &quot;attribution_confidence&gt;=0.7&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suggestion_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"generation_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cause == 'SEASON' AND peer_region_demand > 0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TRANSFER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WAIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cause == 'FORECAST' AND excess_cover_weeks > 12\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PROMOTION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target_cover_weeks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cause == 'PRICING' AND elasticity_est &#x3C; -1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REPRICE_PROMO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cause == 'ASSORTMENT' OR deadstock_state == 'DEAD_CANDIDATE'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CLEARANCE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"brand_price_floor_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"luxury_brands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_gross_margin_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channel_conflict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"deny_same_price_within_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_discount_step_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_action_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transfer_min_savings_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ranking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cash_recovery_efficiency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"formula\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(delta_cash_recovered - action_cost) / (release_days * capital_tied)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tie_breaker\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"capital_tied_desc\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"four_eyes_above_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"require_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nrv_estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attribution_confidence>=0.7\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_discount_step_pct</code> 是防呆设计：阶梯降价而非一步到底，让系统有机会在每一档观察需求响应，同时保护价格带不被一次性击穿。这也是与 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/inventory-provision-finance-link\">存货跌价拨备</a> 的接口——每一档降价都对应一次 NRV 重估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"建议的可解释性\">建议的可解释性</h3><p>每条建议必须能回答「为什么是它」——附上证据链：触发判据、归因结论、成本收益计算、约束检查结果。没有证据链的建议会被执行团队无条件忽略，因为执行者要为此承担结果责任。证据链应包含一个<strong>反事实</strong>：如果不做这个动作，预计的持有成本与最终损失是多少。这个反事实正是 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital\">库存资金占用</a> 里 <code>aging_multiplier</code> 的用途。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fact_action_suggestion (&#10;  suggestion_id     VARCHAR(40) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  generated_at      TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id            VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  source_location   VARCHAR(32),&#10;  target_location   VARCHAR(32),&#10;  action_type       VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  qty               DECIMAL(14,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  suggested_price   DECIMAL(14,4),&#10;  discount_pct      DECIMAL(6,4),&#10;  capital_tied      DECIMAL(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  release_days_est  INTEGER      NOT NULL,&#10;  delta_cash        DECIMAL(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  action_cost_est   DECIMAL(16,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  efficiency_score  DECIMAL(12,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  primary_cause     VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence        DECIMAL(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  constraints_checked JSONB      NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_ref      VARCHAR(256) NOT NULL,&#10;  status            VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;PROPOSED&#39;&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fact_action_suggestion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  suggestion_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span 